  "id": "project-team",
  "term": "project team",
  "definition": "A project team is a group of people who work together on a specific project. In psychology and organizational research, it can be understood as a social unit whose shared ways of reflecting and adapting, such as team reflexivity and resilience, can affect how successful the project is.",
